hadiths[70]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1049","aik Yahudi aurat unke paas maangney ke liye aai aur us ne dua di ke Allah aapko qabr ke azab se bachaaey. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke kya logon ko qabr mein azab hoga? is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main Allah Taala ki us se panah mangta hun."
"1050","phir aik martaba subah ko (kahiin janey ke liye) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sawar huey iske baad suraj girahan laga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) din chadhey wapas huey aur apni beeviyon ke hujron se guzartey huey (masjid mein) Namaz ke liye khadey ho gaey sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki pairvi mein niyat baandh li. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bahut hi lamba qiyam kya phir rukoo bhi bahut lamba kya, iske baad khadey huey aur ab ki baar qiyam phir lamba kya lekin pahley se kuchh kam, phir rukoo kya aur us baar bhi der tak rukoo mein rahe lekin pahley rukoo se kuchh kam, phir rukoo se sar uthaya aur sajde mein gaey. ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) phir dobara khadey huey aur bahut der tak qiyam kya lekin pahley qiyam se kuchh kam, phir aik lamba rukoo kya lekin pahley rukoo se kuchh kam, phir rukoo se sar uthaya aur qiyam mein ab ki baar bhi bahut der tak rahe lekin pahley se kam der tak (chauthi martaba) phir rukoo kya aur bahut der tak rukoo mein rahe lekin pahley se mukhtasar. rukoo se sar uthaya to sajde mein chaley gaey aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is tarah Namaz poori kar li. iske baad Allah Taala ne jo chaha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya usi khutbe mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko hidayat farmai ke azaabe-qabr se Allah ki panah maangein."
"1051","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein suraj ko girahan laga to elaan hua ke Namaz honey wali hai (is Namaz mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik rakaat mein 2 rukoo kiye aur phir dusri rakaat mein bhi 2 rukoo kiye, iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey rahe (Qa'da mein) yahan tak ke suraj saaf ho gaya. Abdullah ne kaha Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke maine us se zyada lamba sajda aur kabhi nahi kya."
"1052","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein suraj ko girahan laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhi thi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne itna lamba qiyam kya ke itni der mein sura al-Baqara padhi ja sakti thi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rukoo lamba kya aur uske baad khadey huey to abki baar bhi qiyam bahut lamba tha lekin pahley se kuchh kam phir aik doosra lamba rukoo kya jo pahley rukoo se kuchh kam tha phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde mein gaey, sajde se uth kar phir lamba qiyam kya lekin pahley qiyam ke muqaabley mein kam lamba tha phir aik lamba rukoo kya. ye rukoo bhi pahley rukoo ke muqaabla mein kam tha rukoo se sar utha ne ke baad phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahut der tak khadey rahe aur ye qiyam bhi pahley se mukhtasar tha. phir ( chotha ( rukoo kya ye bhi bahut lamba tha lekin pahley se kuchh kam . phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sajda kya aur Namaz se farigh huey to suraj saaf ho chuka tha. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutbe mein farmaya ke suraj aur chaand donon Allah Taala ki nishaniyan hain aur kisi ki maut w zindagi ki wjah se unmein girahan nahi lagta isliye jab tum ko malum ho ke girahan lag gaya hai to Allah Taala ka zikr karo. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ya Rasulullah ! ham ne dekha ke (namaz mein) apni jagah se aap kuchh aagey badhey aur phir iske baad peechhey hat gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine jannat dekhi aur uska ek khosha todnaa chaha tha agar main usey tod sakta to tum usey rehti duniya tak khaatey aur mujhey jahannam bhi dikhai gaee maine us se zyada bhayanak aur khofnak manzar kabhi nahi dekha. maine dekha usmein auratein zyada hain. kisi ne puchha ya Rasulullah! uski kya wjah hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne kufr ( inkaar) ki wjah se. puchha gaya, kya Allah Taala ka kufr ( inkaar) karti hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shauhar ka aur ehsan ka kufr karti hain. zindagi bhar tum kisi aurat ke sath achchha sulook karo lekin kabhi agar koi mizaaj k khilaf baat aa gaee to fauran yahi kahegii ke maine tum se kabhi bhalai nahi dekhi."
"1053","jab suraj ko girahan laga to main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar aai. achcha log khadey huey Namaz padh rahe they aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bhi Namaz mein Sharik thi maine puchha ke logon ko baat kya pesh aaii? is par aap ne aasman ki taraf ishara karke Subhan-Allah kaha, phir maine puchha kya koi nishani hai? iska aap ne ishaare se haan mein jawab diya. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir main bhi khadi ho gaee. lekin mujhey chakkar aa gaya isliye main apne sar par pani dalney lagi jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz se farigh huey to Allah Taala ki hamd w sana ke baad farmaya ke wo cheezein jo ke maine pahley nahi dekhi thin ab unhein maine apni usi jagah se dekh liya. jannat aur dozakh tak maine dekhi aur mujhey wahiy ke zariey bataya gaya hai ke tum qabr mein dajjal ke fitne ki tarah ya (ye kaha ke) dajjal ke fitna ke qareeb aik fitne mein mubtala hogey. mujhey yad nahi ke Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne kya kaha tha aap ne farmaya ke tumhen laya jaeyga aur puchha jaeyga ke us shakhs (mujh (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ke barey main tum kya jantey ho. momin ya ye kaha ke yaqin karne wala (mujhey yad nahi ke un 2 baton mein se Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne kon si baat kahi thi) to kahega ye Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamarey samney sahi rasta aur uske dalaayel pesh kiye aur ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par eman laey they aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baat qabool ki aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ittaba (pairvi) kya tha. is par us se kaha jaeyga ke to marde-Saaleh hai to aaraam se so ja hamein to pahley hi malum tha ke to eman w yaqin wala hai. munafiq ya shak karne wala nahi (mujhey malum nahi ke Asma (Raziallahu anha) ne kya kaha tha) wo ye kahega ke mujhey kuchh malum nahi maine logon se aik baat suni thi wahi maine bhi kahi (aagey mujh ko kuchh haqiqat malum nahin) ."
"1054","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne suraj girahan mein ghulam aazad karne ka hukm farmaayaa."
"1055","aik Yahudi aurat unke paas kuchh maangney aai. usne kaha ke aapko Allah Taala qabr ke azab se bachaaey, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke kya qabr mein bhi azab hoga? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (ye sun kar) farmaya ke main Allah ki us se panah mangta hun."
"1056","phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din subah ke waqt sawar huey (kahiin janey ke liye) idhar suraj girahan lag gaya isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas aa gaey, abhi chasht ka waqt tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni beeviyon ke hujron se guzrey aur (masjid mein) khadey ho kar Namaz shuru kar di sahaba bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein saf baandh kar khadey ho gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qiyam bahut lamba kya, rukoo bhi bahut lamba kya phir rukoo se sar uthane ke baad dobara lamba qiyam kya lekin pahley se kam, iske baad rukoo bahut lamba kya lekin pahley rukoo se kuchh kam. phir rukoo se sar utha kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde mein gaey aur lamba sajda kya. phir lamba qiyam kya aur ye qiyam bhi pahley se kam tha. phir lamba rukoo kya agarche ye rukoo bhi pahley ke muqaabley mein kam tha phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukoo se khadey ho gaey aur lamba qiyam kya lekin ye qiyam phir pahley se kam tha ab (chauthaa) rukoo kya, agarche ye rukoo bhi pahley rukoo ke muqaabley mein kam tha. phir sajda kya bahut lamba lekin pahley sajde ke muqaabley mein kam. Namaz se farigh honey ke baad jo kuchh Allah Taala ne chaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya, phir logon ko samjhaayaa ke qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah maangein."
"1057","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya suraj aur chaand mein girahan kisi ki maut ki wjah se nahi lagta albatta ye donon Allah Taala ki nishaniyan hain, isliye jab tum girahan dekho to Namaz padho."
"1058","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein suraj ko girahan laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur logon ke sath Namaz mein mashghool ho gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne lambi qirat ki. phir rukoo kya aur ye bhi bahut lamba tha. phir sar uthaya aur us martaba bhi der tak qirat ki magar pehli qirat se kam. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (doosri martaba) rukoo kya bahut lamba lekin pahley ke muqable mein mukhtasar, phir rukoo se sar utha kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde mein chaley gaey aur 2 sajdey kiye phir khadey huey aur dusri rakaat mein bhi isi tarah kya jaisey pehli rakaat mein kar chukey they. iske baad farmaya ke suraj aur chaand mein girahan kisi ki maut w hayaat se nahi lagtaa. albatta ye donon Allah Taala ki nishaniyan hain jinhein Allah Taala apne bandon ko dikhaataa hai, isliye jab tum unhein dekho to fauran Namaz ke liye daudo."
"1059","aik baar suraj girahan hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahut ghabraa kar uthey us dar se ke kahin qiyamat na qaaim ho jaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid mein aa kar bahut hi lamba qiyaam, lamba rukoo aur lambey sajdon ke sath Namaz padhi. maine kabhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is tarah kartey nahi dekha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz ke baad farmaya ke ye nishaniyan hain jinhein Allah Taala bhejta hai ye kisi ki maut aur zindagi ki wjah se nahi aatiin balke Allah Taala inke zariey apne bandon ko daraataa hai isliye jab tum is tarah ki koi cheez dekho to fauran Allah Taala ke zikr aur usse istighfar ki taraf lapko."
"1060","jis din Ibrahim (Raziallahu anhu) ki maut hui suraj girahan bhi isi din laga. is par kuchh logon ne kaha ke girahan Ibrahim (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke saahibzaadey) ki wafat ki wjah se laga hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke suraj aur chaand Allah Taala ki nishaniyon mein se do nishan hain. unmein girahan kisi ki maut w hayaat ki wjah se nahi lagtaa. jab usey dekho to Allah paak se dua karo aur Namaz padho yahan tak ke suraj saaf ho jaey."
"1061","jab suraj saaf ho gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz se farigh huey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutba diya. pahley Allah Taala ki shaan ke mutabiq uski tareef ki iske baad farmaya (ammaa ba'd)."
"1062","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak mein suraj ko girahan laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 rakaat Namaz padhi thi."
"1063","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein suraj girahan laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni chadar ghaseet'tey huey (badii tezi se) masjid mein pahunchey. sahaba bhi jama ho gaey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein do rakaat Namaz padhai, girahan bhi khatm ho gaya. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke suraj aur chaand Allah Taala ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain aur unmein girahan kisi ki maut par nahi lagta isliye jab girahan lagey to us waqt tak Namaz aur dua mein mashghool raho jab tak ye saaf na ho jaey. ye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isliye farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aik sahibzadey Ibrahim ki wafat (usi din) hui thi aur kuchh log unke mutaalliq kehney lagey they (ke girahan unki maut par laga hai)."
"1064","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne suraj girahan ki 2 rakaton mein char rukoo kiye aur pehli rakaat dusri rakaat se lambi thi."
"1065","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne girahan ki Namaz mein qirat buland awaz se ki, qirat se farigh ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) takbeer keh kar rukoo mein chaley gaey jab rukoo se sar uthaya to ( سمع الله لمن حمده , Mina padhi. ربنا ولك الحمد‏ ( kaha phir dobara qirat shuru ki. gharaz girahan ki 2 rakaton mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne char rukoo aur char sajdey kiye."
"1066","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein suraj girahan laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi se elaan kara diya ke Namaz honey wali hai phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 rakatein char rukoo aur char sajdon ke sath padhin. Waleed-bin-muslim ne bayan kya ke mujhey Abdur-Rehman bin namr ne khabar di aur unhon-ne ibne-Shahab se suna, usi hadis ki tarah Zohri (ibne-Shahaab) ne bayan kya ke is par maine (Urwa se) puchha ke phir tumharey bhai Abdullah-bin-Zubair ne jab Madina mein (kusoof) ki Namaz padhai to kyon aisa kya ke jis tarah subah ki Namaz padhi jati hai. isi tarah ye Namaz ( kusoof ( bhi unhon-ne padhai. unhon-ne jawab diya ke yahan unhon-ne sunnat ke khilaf kya. Abdur-Rehman bin namr ke sath us hadis ko Sulaimaan-bin-Kaseer aur Sufiyaan-bin-Husain ne bhi Zohri se riwayat kya, usmein bhi qirat awaz k sath karne ka bayan hai."
"1067","Makka main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sura Najm ki tilawat ki aur sajda tilawat kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jitney aadmi they ( musalman aur kaafir ( un sab ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath sajda kya albatta aik boodha shakhs ( Umayya-bin-Khalaf ( apne hath mein kankari ya mitti utha kar apni peshani tak ley gaya aur kaha mere liye yahi kafi hai maine dekha ke baad mein wo boodha haalate-kufr mein hi maara gaya."
"1068","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Juma ke din fajr ki Namaz main ( الم تنزيل‏ السجدة) aur Sura Dahar padha kartey they."
"1069","sura Swaad ka sajda kuchh taakidi sajdon mein se nahi hai aur maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sajda kartey huey dekha."
"1070","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sura Najm ki tilawat ki aur is mein sajda kya us waqt qaum ka koi fard ( musalman aur kaafir ( bhi aisa na tha jisne sajda na kya ho. albatta aik shakhs ( Umayya-bin-Khalaf ( ne hath mein kankari ya mitti lekar apne chehre tak uthai aur kaha ke mere liye yahi kafi hai. Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke baad mein maine dekha ke wo kufr ki haalat hi mein qatl hua."
"1071","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sura Najm mein sajda kya to muslmaanon, mushrikon aur jinnon aur insanon sab ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath sajda kya. us hadis ki riwayat Ibrahim bin tahmaan ne bhi Ayub sakhtiyan se ki hai."
"1072","unhon-ne-Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se sawal kya. aap ne yaqin ke sath is baat ka izhar kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney sura Najm ki tilawat aap ne ki thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein sajda nahi kya."
"1073","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney sura Najm ki tilawat ki aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein sajda nahi kya."
"1074","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko sura ( إذا السماء انشقت‏ ( padhtey dekha. aap ne usmein sajda kya maine kaha ke aey Abu-Hurera ! kya maine aapko sajda kartey huey nahi dekha hai. aap ne kaha ke agar main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sajda kartey na dekhta to main bhi na karta."
"1075","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamari maujoodgii mein aayate-sajda padhtey aur sajda kartey to ham bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ( hujoom ki wjah se) is tarah sajda kartey ke peshani rakhney ki jagah bhi na miltii jis par sajda kartey."
"1076","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aayate-sajda ki tilawat agar hamari maujoodgii mein kartey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ham bhi sajda kartey they. us waqt itni bheed ho jati ke sajde ke liye peshani rakhney ki jagah na miltii jis par sajda karne wala sajda kar sakey."
"1077","Rabee bahut achchhey logon mein se they Rabee ne wo haal bayan kya jo Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ki majlis mein unhon-ne dekha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Juma ke din member par sura Nahal padhi jab sajde ki aayat ( ‏‏‏‏ولله يسجد ما في السمٰوٰت ( Mina aakhir tak pahunchey to member par se utrey aur sajda kya to logon ne bhi unke sath sajda kya. doosrey Juma ko phir yahi sura padhi jab sajde ki aayat par pahunchey to kehney lagey logo! ham sajde ki aayat padhtey chaley jatey hain phir jo koi sajda karey usne achchha kya aur jo koi na karey to is par kuchh gunah nahi aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne sajda nahi kya aur Naafe ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se naql kya ke Allah Taala ne sajda tilawat farz nahi kya hamari khushi par rakha."
"1078","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath namaaze-ishaa padhi. aap ne ( إذا السماء انشقت‏ ( ki tilawat ki aur sajda kya. maine arz kya ke aap ne ye kya kya? unhon-ne iska jawab diya ke maine usmein abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein sajda kya tha aur hamesha sajda karta rahunga yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ja miloon."
"1079","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi aisi sura ki tilawat kartey jis mein sajda hota, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajda kartey aur ham bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath sajda kartey yahan tak ke ham mein kisi ko apni peshani rakhney ki jagah na miltii. (ma'loom hua ke aisi haalat mein sajda na kya jaey to koi harj nahi hai) ( والله أعلم ( ."
"1080","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka mein fateh Makka ke mauqe par) unnees din thahrey aur barabar qasr kartey rahe. isliye unnees din ke safar mein ham bhi qasr kartey rahtey hain aur us se agar zyada ho jaey to poori Namaz padhtey hain."
"1081","ham Makka ke irade se Madina se nikley to barabar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2-2 rakaat padhtey rahe. yahan tak ke ham Madina wapas aaey. maine puchha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka Makka mein kuchh din qiyam bhi raha tha? to uska jawab Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye diya ke das din tak ham wahan thahrey they."
"1082","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Mina mein 2 rakaat (yani char rakaat wali namazon mein) qasr padhi. Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath bhi unke daure-khilaafat ke shuru mein 2 hi rakaat padhi thin. lekin baad mein aap (Raziallahu anhu) ne poori padhi thin."
"1083","aap ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Mina mein amn ki haalat mein hamein 2 rakaat Namaz padhai thi."
"1084","maine Abdur-Rehman bin Yazeed se suna, wo kehtey they ke hamein Usman-bin-Affan (Raziallahu anhu) ne Mina mein char rakaat Namaz padhai thi lekin jab iska zikr Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se kya gaya to unhon-ne kaha ke (انا لله و انا اليه راجعون). phir kehney lagey maine to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Mina mein 2 rakaat Namaz padhi hai aur Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath bhi maine 2 rakaat hi padhi hain aur umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath bhi 2 rakaat hi padhi thi kash! mere hisse mein un char rakaton ke bajaey 2 maqbool rakatein hotiin."
"1085","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sahaba ko sath lekar talbiya kehtey huey Zil-Hijja ki chothi taareekh ko (Makka mein) tashrif laey phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jinke paas qurbani ka janwar nahi hai wo bajaey Haj ke Umra ki niyat kar lein aur Umra se farigh ho kar halal ho jayen phir Haj ka ehram baandhein. is hadis ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ata ne Jaabir se ki hai."
"1086","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye farman naql kya tha ke auratein teen din ka safar kisi mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) ke baghair na karein (abu-Usaama ne kaha haan)."
"1087","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aurat teen din ka safar us waqt tak na karey jab tak iske sath koi mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) rishtedar na ho. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ahmed ne ibne-Mubarak se ki unse Ubaidullah Umri ne unse Naafe ne aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hawale se."
"1088","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kisi khatun ke liye jo Allah aur uske rasool par eman rakhti ho, jaaiz nahi ke aik din raat ka safar baghair kisi zi raham mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) ke kare. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Yahya-bin-abi-Kasir , Suhel aur Malik ne Maqbari se ki. wo is riwayat ko Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kartey they."
"1089","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina Munawra mein Zohar ki char rakaat padhi aur zul-Hulaifa mein Asr ki 2 rakaat padhi."
"1090","pahley Namaz 2 rakaat farz hui thi baad main safar ki Namaz to apni usi haalat par reh gaee albatta hazar ki Namaz poori (chaar rakaat ( kar di gaee. Zohri ne bayan kya ke maine Urwa se puchha ke phir khud Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kyon Namaz poori padhi thi unhon-ne iska jawab ye diya ke Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ne uski jo taaweel ki thi wahi unhon-ne bhi ki."
"1092","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne maghrib ki Namaz us din der mein padhi thi jab unhein unki biwi Safiya-binte-abii Ubaid ki sakht bimari ki itlaa mili thi (chaltey huey) maine kaha ke namaaz! (yani waqt khatm hua chahta hai) lekin aap ne farmaya ke chaley chalo phir dobara maine kaha ke Namaz ! aap ne phir farmaya ke chaley chalo is tarah jab ham 2 ya teen meel nikal gaey to aap utrey aur Namaz padhi phir farmaya ke maine khud dekha hai ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein tezi ke sath chalnaa chahtey to isi tarah kartey they Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bhi farmaya ke maine khud dekha ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (manzile-maqsood tak) jaldi pahunchnaa chahtey to pahley maghrib ki takbeer kahalwaatey aur aap uski teen rakaat padha kar salam phertey. phir thodi der thahar kar isha padhatey aur uski 2 hi rakaat par salam phertey. isha ke farz ke baad aap sunnatein wghaira nahi padhtey they aadhi raat ke baad khadey ho kar Namaz padhtey."
"1093","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke ontni par Namaz padhtey rahtey chahe iska munh kisi taraf ho."
"1094","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nafl Namaz apni ontni par ghair qible ki taraf munh karke bhi padhtey they."
"1095","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) nafl Namaz sawari par padhtey they. isi tarah witr bhii. aur farmatey ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi aisa kartey they."
"1096","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) safar main apni ontni par Namaz padhtey chahe iska munh kisi taraf hota. aap isharon se Namaz padhtey . aap ka bayan tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi isi tarah kartey they."
"1097","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ontni par Namaz nafl padhtey dekha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sar ke isharon se padh rahe they iska khayal kiye baghair ke sawari ka munh kidhar hota hai lekin farz namazon mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is tarah nahi kartey they."
"1098","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) safar mein raat ke waqt apne janwar par Namaz padhtey kuchh parwah na kartey ke iska munh kis taraf hai. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi ontni par nafl Namaz padha kartey chahey iska munh kidhar hi ho aur witr bhi sawari par padh letey they albatta farz is par nahi padhtey they."
"1099","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni ontni par mashriq ki taraf munh kiye huey Namaz padhtey they aur jab farz padhtey to sawari se utar jatey aur phir qible ki taraf rukh karke padhtey ."
"1100","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) Sham (Syria) se jab ( Hajjaj ki khaleefa se shikayat karke) wapas huey to ham unse Ainut-Tamar mein miley. maine dekha ke aap gadhey par Sawar hokar Namaz padh rahe they aur aap ka munh qible se baain taraf tha. is par maine kaha ke maine aapko qible ke siwa dusri taraf munh karke Namaz padhtey huey dekha hai. unhon-ne jawab diya ke agar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa kartey na dekhta to main bhi na karta. is riwayat ko Ibrahim ibne- tahmaan ne bhi Hajjaj se, unhon-ne Anas bin Sirin se, unhon-ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kya hai."
"1101","maine safar mein sunnaton ke mutaalliq Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha aap ne farmaya ke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat mein raha hun. maine aapko safar mein kabhi sunnatein padhtey nahi dekha aur Allah ka irshad hai ke tumharey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi behtreen namoona hai."
"1102","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat mein raha hun, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein 2 rakaat (farz) se zyada nahi padha kartey they abu-Bakar, umr aur Usman (Raziallahu anhu) bhi aisa hi kartey they."
"1103","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unhon-ne chasht ki Namaz padhtey dekha haan Umme-Hani (Raziallahu anhu) ka bayan hai ke fateh Makka ke din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke ghar ghusl kya tha aur uske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aath (8) rakatein padhi thin, maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi itni halki phulkii Namaz padhtey nahi dekha albatta Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukoo aur sajda poori tarah kartey they."
"1104","unhon-ne khud dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (raat mein) safar mein nafl namazein sawari par padhtey they, wo jidhar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ley jati udhar hi sahii."
"1105","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni ontni ki peeth par chahe iska munh kisi taraf hota nafl Namaz sar ke isharon se padhtey they. Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi isi tarah kya kartey they."
"1106","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko agar safar mein jald chalnaa manzoor hota to maghrib aur isha aik sath mila kar padhtey."
"1107","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein Zohar aur Asr ki Namaz aik sath mila kar padhtey, isi tarah maghrib aur isha ki bhi aik sath mila kar padhtey they."
"1108","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein maghrib aur isha aik sath mila kar padhtey they. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ali bin-Mubarak aur Harab ne Yahya se ki hai. Yahyaa, Hafs se aur Hafs Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (maghrib aur ishaa) aik sath mila kar padhi thin."
"1109","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jab jaldi safar tay karna hota to maghrib ki Namaz me deri kar detey. phir usey isha ke sath mila kar padhtey they. Salim ne bayan kya ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi agar safar tezi ke sath tay karna chahtey to isi tarah kartey they. maghrib ki takbeer pahley kahi jati aur aap teen rakaat maghrib ki Namaz padh kar salam pher detey. phir maamooli se thehraaw ke baad isha ki takbeer kahi jati aur aap uski 2 rakatein padh kar salam pher detey. donon namazon ke darmyan aik rakaat bhi sunnat wghaira na padhtey aur isi tarah isha ke baad bhi Namaz nahi padhtey they. yahan tak ke raat ke beech mein aap uthtey (aur tahajjud ada kartey)."
"1110","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un 2 namazon yani maghrib aur isha ko safar mein aik sath mila kar padha kartey they."
"1111","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) agar suraj dhalney se pahley safar shuru kartey to Zohar ki namaze-Asr tak na padhtey phir Zohar aur Asr aik sath padhtey aur agar suraj dhal chuka hota to pahley Zohar padh letey phir sawar hotey."
"1112","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab suraj dhalney se pahley safar shuru kartey to Zohar Asr ka waqt aaney tak na padhtey. phir kahin (raastey mein) thahartey aur Zohar aur Asr mila kar padhtey lekin agar safar shuru karne se pahley suraj dhal chuka hota to pahley Zohar padhtey phir sawar hotey."
"1113","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bimar they isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ghar mein baith kar Namaz padhai, kuchh log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey khadey ho kar padhney lagey. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein ishara kya ke baith jao. Namaz se farigh honey ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke imam isliye hai ke uski pairwi ki jaey isliye jab wo rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo aur jab wo sar uthaey to tum bhi sar uthaao."
"1114","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghodey se gir padey aur uski wjah se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daain pahlu par zakhm aa gaey. ham haal-chaal poochhney ke liye gaey to Namaz ka waqt aa gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baith kar Namaz padhai. ham ne bhi baith kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey Namaz padhi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi mauqe par farmaya tha ke imam isliye hai taake uski pairwi ki jaey. isliye jab wo takbeer kahey to tum bhi takbeer kaho, jab wo rukoo karey to tum bhi rukoo karo, jab wo sar uthaey to tum bhi sar uthao aur jab wo ( سمع الله لمن حمده ( kahey to tum ( ربنا ولك الحمد ( kaho."
"1115","aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha (doosri sanad) aur hamein Ishaq-bin-Mansur ne khabar di, kaha ke hamein Abdus-Samad ne khabar di, kaha ke maine apne bap Abdul-Waris se suna, kaha ke ham se Husain ne bayan kya aur unse ibne-bareeda ne kaha ke mujh se Imran-bin-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, wo bawaaseer ke mareez they unhon-ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kisi aadmi ke baith kar Namaz padhney ke barey mein puchha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke afzal yahi hai ke khadey ho kar padhey kyonke baith kar padhney waley ko khadey ho kar padhney waley se aadha sawab milta hai aur letey-letey padhney waley ko baith kar padhney waley se aadha sawab milta hai."
"1116","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baith kar Namaz padhney ke barey mein puchha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khadey ho kar Namaz padhna afzal hai lekin agar koi baith kar Namaz padhey to khadey ho kar padhney waley se usey aadha sawab milega aur let kar padhney waley ko baith kar padhney waley se aadha sawab milega. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( farmatey hain ke hadis ke alfaz main ( نائم ( ) مضطجع (ke mana mein hai yani let kar Namaz padhney wala."
"1117","mujhey bawaaseer ka marz tha. isliye maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Namaz ke barey mein malum kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khadey ho kar Namaz padha karo agar uski bhi taqat na ho to baith kar aur agar uski bhi na ho to pahlu ke bal let kar padh lo."
"1118","aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi baith kar Namaz padhtey nahi dekha albatta jab aap zaeef ho gaey to Quran ki qir'at namaaz mein baith kar kartey they, phir jab rukoo ka waqt aata to khadey ho jatey aur phir taqriban tees ya chalis (40) aayatein padh kar rukoo kartey."
"1119","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tahajjud ki Namaz baith kar padhna chahtey to qirat baith kar kartey. jab taqriban tees chalis (40) aayatein padhni baqi reh jaatiin to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein khadey ho kar padhtey. phir rukoo aur sajda kartey phir dusri rakaat mein bhi isi tarah kartey. Namaz se farigh honey par dekhtey ke main jaag rahi hun to mujh se baatein kartey lekin agar main soti hoti to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi let jatey."